# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify redirect rules.
#
# The build emits /pricing.html rather than /pricing/index.html, and most
# hosts resolve the extensionless URL to it on their own. These rules make
# that explicit, and send the trailing-slash variant to the canonical form
# so a shared link with a slash does not become a second URL to index.

/*/                 /:splat                     301
/index.html         /                           301
/404                /404.html                   200
